    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>|</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is constant of integration, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
